Sorry talaga.

280
00:19:34.565 --> 00:19:35.844
Walang malaking kawalan!

281
00:19:36.324 --> 00:19:39.201
Kung hindi dahil sa hagdan,
Siguradong kukunin nila ako.

282
00:19:43.916 --> 00:19:46.034
Puntahan natin si Sung Jae?

283
00:19:58.741 --> 00:19:59.900
Sol, pupunta ka ba dyan?

284
00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.698
Magsisimula na ang concert!

285
