00:30:20.120 --> 00:30:21.998
Nalunok mo na ba ang iyong dila?

344
00:30:39.620 --> 00:30:40.779
Nakita kong nagyelo sila.

345
00:30:50.170 --> 00:30:51.808
salamat po.

346
