347
00:30:57.163 --> 00:30:58.242
Hindi ako umiyak.

348
00:30:59.401 --> 00:31:02.717
Dahil sa tuwa.

349
00:31:04.995 --> 00:31:09.870
To be honest, I'm your, your, fan mo.

350
00:31:10.589 --> 00:31:11.589
Ito ay nakikita.

351
00:31:23.696 --> 00:31:24.696
Nakakatawa ka.

352
00:31:24.935 --> 00:31:27.932
GRAB SUN JAE AT TUMAKBO
Ito ang aking palayaw sa iyong fan cafe.

353
00:31:28.771 --> 00:31:31.728
Naisip ko ito 10 taon na ang nakakaraan.

354
00:31:31.808 --> 00:31:33.167
Hindi kailanman nagbago ito!

355
00:31:33.606 --> 00:31:34.606
salamat po.

356
00:31:35.924 --> 00:31:37.483
salamat po.

