At wala man lang makausap.

480
00:47:37.722 --> 00:47:39.800
Hindi ko alam na sobrang sama ng pakiramdam mo.

481
00:47:40.280 --> 00:47:42.038
Hindi ko alam, patawarin mo ako.

482
00:47:46.793 --> 00:47:48.272
Mahal kita, Sung Jae!

483
00:47:54.865 --> 00:47:56.983
