485
00:48:00.060 --> 00:48:03.736
Song Jae! Mahal kita, Sung Jae!

486
00:48:03.816 --> 00:48:05.534
Song Jae!

487
00:48:05.614 --> 00:48:09.850
Hayaan mo na! Ryu Sung Jae!

488
00:48:11.728 --> 00:48:15.564
Ako na mismo ang lalabas, teka. Teka!

489
00:48:15.644 --> 00:48:17.243
Papasok ako saglit.

490
00:48:17.323 --> 00:48:19.121
- Hindi.
- Ito ay ipinagbabawal.

491
00:48:19.201 --> 00:48:21.718
Makinig, babae, huwag mo lang sabihin sa akin,
ang nakita ko!

492
00:48:21.798 --> 00:48:24.675
- Huling pagkakataon...
- Umalis ka na dito!

493
00:48:25.475 --> 00:48:28.112
