519
00:50:31.908 --> 00:50:33.666
Ito ay sa iyo, kunin mo sila.

520
00:50:34.146 --> 00:50:35.624
- Aking?
- Oo.

521
00:50:35.704 --> 00:50:37.143
Magaling.

522
00:50:38.182 --> 00:50:42.018
I'll be there para hindi mo maramdaman
kalungkutan.

523
00:50:44.855 --> 00:50:47.692
Kawawa kong ina, ano ang mangyayari sa kanya?

524
00:50:47.892 --> 00:50:52.008
Nanay... Lola...

525
00:50:52.088 --> 00:50:55.245
Hindi, hindi pa lumilipas ang isang buwan, may paraan.

526
00:50:56.763 --> 00:50:58.002
Sabay tayong bumalik.

527
00:50:58.322 --> 00:51:00.280
Wag ka lang umalis.

528
00:51:00.360 --> 00:51:02.038
kailangan ko ng umuwi.

529
00:51:02.717 --> 00:51:03.717
Hindi!

530
00:51:04.875 --> 00:51:06.513
Hindi, Sung Jae, hindi mo kaya!

531
00:51:06.593 --> 00:51:08.432
Pwede. kaya ko.

532
00:51:09.870 --> 00:51:11.229
Hindi, Sung Jae!

533
00:51:12.507 --> 00:51:14.266
Mabuhay tayo, okay?

534
