560
00:52:41.379 --> 00:52:42.737
ayos lang.

561
00:52:47.013 --> 00:52:49.011
Dad, sasama na ako.

562
00:52:50.010 --> 00:52:51.568
Oo. Tatawagan ulit kita.

563
00:53:00.160 --> 00:53:03.437
Kung gaano kahirap ang magdusa
mag-isa.

564
00:53:03.916 --> 00:53:06.354
At wala man lang makausap.

565
00:53:06.793 --> 00:53:08.871
Hindi ko alam na sobrang sama ng pakiramdam mo.

566
00:53:09.231 --> 00:53:11.069
Hindi ko alam, patawarin mo ako.

567
00:53:11.668 --> 00:53:13.107
Mahal kita, Sung Jae!

